{"description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Century Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Title: </strong></span></span><span style=\"mso-tab-count:2;\" lang=\"EN-US\">             </span><span style=\"font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Helpdesk Specialist (Level 3)</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Century Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Department:</strong></span></span><span style=\"mso-tab-count:1;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Customer Success</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Century Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Location:</strong></span></span><span style=\"mso-tab-count:2;\" lang=\"EN-US\">                 </span><span style=\"font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Bucharest, Romania (hybrid working available)</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Century Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Reporting to: </strong></span></b></span><a name=\"_Hlk129683447\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Helpdesk Team Leader</span></span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#06BBB4;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Archivo-Bold;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Purpose of the position</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-color:white;vertical-align:bottom;\"> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Our customer journey extends beyond the purchase of our products and services; it is complemented by the support we provide to ensure our customers can consistently and reliably deliver services to their own customers.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">As a Helpdesk Specialist (Level 3), you will provide remote diagnostic technical support and resolution to Helpdesk Specialists (Level 2), enabling our customers’ forecourt sites to remain operational across Vontier’s customer base in EMEA in the most effective and cost-efficient manner, while minimizing the effort required to resolve issues.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">This role includes support for Point of Sale (POS) products, Head Office and Back Office systems, payment terminals, payment systems, forecourt controllers, and IT- and cloud-based applications. The primary focus of the role is to resolve issues in a timely manner without the need to dispatch a Field Service Engineer, while meeting contractual SLA (Service Level Agreement) requirements and ensuring full customer satisfaction.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Where new issues are identified, you will be responsible for analysis, log collection, and appropriate escalation to the next level of support, as well as full follow-up and ownership until the issue is resolved on site and the customer has confirmed resolution.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">This is a highly customer-focused support role, requiring regular communication with both external customers and internal colleagues to drive resolution.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;\"> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:-13.5pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#06BBB4;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Archivo-Bold;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;vertical-align:middle;\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">       </span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI\";\" lang=\"EN-US\">Proactively access Vontier’s helpdesk portals to review logged cases and triage them appropriately, establishing priorities in line with the relevant contract and SLA.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;vertical-align:middle;\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">       </span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI\";\" lang=\"EN-US\">Verify whether the customer-reported issue is still present and attempt to resolve it remotely. If a remote fix is not possible, escalate or share the necessary information to support an on-site field analysis, depending on the contract type.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;vertical-align:middle;\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">       </span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI\";\" lang=\"EN-US\">Gather and record all information clearly and accurately, including the initial issue description, resolution provided, and any knowledge base references used.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;vertical-align:middle;\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">       </span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI\";\" lang=\"EN-US\">Update the relevant call management portal or intranet as appropriate once remote fixes have been completed.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;vertical-align:middle;\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">       </span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI\";\" lang=\"EN-US\">Provide excellent customer support, managing expectations sensitively and communicating clearly throughout so customers are reassured and informed of next steps and timescales.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;vertical-align:middle;\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">       </span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI\";\" lang=\"EN-US\">Support on-site customer representatives through disaster recovery procedures and system update processes.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;vertical-align:middle;\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">       </span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI\";\" lang=\"EN-US\">Carry out trend analysis on recurring alarms and repeated issues, identify root causes, and work with other internal teams to help resolve them.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;vertical-align:middle;\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">       </span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI\";\" lang=\"EN-US\">Recommend to the Team Leader any required standard work documentation for remote fix scripts and diagnostic support, and contribute updates to the shared technical knowledge base for each product.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;vertical-align:middle;\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-list:Ignore;\" lang=\"EN-US\">       </span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI\";\" lang=\"EN-US\">Travel occasionally to customer sites, partner locations, Vontier sites, or other locations as required.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"background-color:white;mso-add-space:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-a